2
00:02:45,454 --> 00:02:51,174
高鳴る心に祈りを乗せて 曖昧な夢を描く
With prayers riding on my beating heart, I trace an ambiguous dream

3
00:02:51,274 --> 00:02:55,224
幻想は想像のまま 終われないんだ
These illusions cannot end just as mere imagination

4
00:02:55,574 --> 00:03:04,224
Diva! みんな今日を見に来てくれてありがとう！
Diva! Thank you everyone for coming to see me today!

5
00:03:06,314 --> 00:03:17,554
答えを永遠と探し続けて 何者かになりたくて 燦々と震える夜を ただ流れた
Continuing to search forever for the answer, wanting to become someone special, I simply drifted through nights trembling brilliantly

6
00:03:17,804 --> 00:03:26,554
優しく寄り添って 心が晴れるのなら 翼が生えたような気がして いつだって隣にいるから
If gently leaning close clears your heart, it feels as though wings have grown, because I will always be right by your side

7
00:03:32,144 --> 00:03:37,954
だって言葉紡いで歌うことが 私の運命だ
Because spinning words and singing them is my destiny

8
00:03:38,054 --> 00:03:43,464
世界に溢れた虚しささえも 上書きして
Overwriting even the emptiness overflowing in this world

9
00:03:44,204 --> 00:03:52,754
路地裏に咲いた花のように 願いを照らす小さな光に 憧れて
Yearning for a small light that illuminates wishes, like a flower blooming in a back alley

10
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:11,500
名前を持たない歌なんて 神様は認めてくれない
Even songs without a name, God will not acknowledge them

11
00:04:12,200 --> 00:04:16,800
一つ一つ枯れない花のように
Like flowers that never wither, one by one

12
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:23,000
昨日の自分にさよならして こぼれた涙
Saying goodbye to yesterday's self, the spilled tears

13
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:29,000
うまく笑えなくてもいいから
It's okay even if you can't smile well

14
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:34,500
だって理想は届くばっかりで もう散々だよ
Because ideals just keep staying out of reach, I'm already so exhausted

15
00:04:35,300 --> 00:04:40,200
どれだけ手を伸ばして 叫んだって届かないの
No matter how much I stretch out my hands and cry out, they don't reach

16
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:51,200
望めばいつか叶うはずって 信じてる とか歌おう響いて
Hoping that someday it's bound to come true, believing it—let's sing, let it echo

17
00:04:55,100 --> 00:05:00,800
あぁ心臓の音が今日も煩い
Ah, the sound of my heartbeat is noisy again today

18
00:05:01,164 --> 00:05:05,484
大きどき 変異じゃないけど 冗談なら笑えないよ
Strange anomalies are fine, but I can't laugh at jokes like that!

19
00:05:05,864 --> 00:05:10,504
中途半端 どっちを向こうの 新機動に手を伸ばした
Reaching out with a fresh start, unsure which way to face...

20
00:05:10,504 --> 00:05:13,964
秘密のような 夢物語り
Like a secret, dreamlike story...

21
00:05:13,964 --> 00:05:19,924
そんな光は 見ないふりしてた
I used to pretend I couldn't see such a light.

22
00:05:20,024 --> 00:05:24,004
ざわめく心 まだ行かないで まだ殺しちゃやばいよ
My restless heart, don't go yet—it'd be bad to kill it off!

23
00:05:24,004 --> 00:05:28,364
私を奪って ニュアンスの斬新なジンマ
Steal me away, with that fresh, cutting-edge nuance.

24
00:05:28,364 --> 00:05:33,304
広がって治まんなユニバース
Spread out and won't settle down, universe!

25
00:05:33,444 --> 00:05:37,524
君の表情は 私の心知らずと
Your expression is oblivious to my true feelings...

26
00:05:37,524 --> 00:05:42,184
すり替えちゃうよ 責任重大ね
Substituting them—what a heavy responsibility!

27
00:05:42,184 --> 00:05:48,224
一才合切 ダンス ダンス ダンス ウィア ダンスリブ
Everything, all at once! Dance, dance, dance, we are dancing reed!

28
