[Title: ときのそら お披露目誕生日2026]
[Title: Tokino Sora Birthday Party 2026]

286
00:38:44,135 --> 00:38:47,435
[Title: GUEST 風真いろは]
[Title: GUEST Kazama Iroha]

287
00:39:05,935 --> 00:39:09,935
[Title: ヒビカセ 作詞: Reol 作曲: Giga]
[Title: Hibikase Lyrics: Reol Music: Giga]

288
00:39:33,035 --> 00:39:39,935
真夜中に続く 音の警報 今日は何によう 午前零時
A sound alarm echoing in the dead of night, what shall we make of it this midnight?

289
00:39:40,135 --> 00:39:46,935
あなたが触れる 光眩暈 指先に踊らされた
The dazzling light you touch dances upon my fingertips.

290
00:39:47,135 --> 00:39:53,435
輪郭 測ってみた 深まる夜ふたりだけの秘密
Tracing the outlines, a secret shared by just the two of us in the deepening night.

291
00:39:53,635 --> 00:40:00,450
輪郭 測ってみた 重なる波形に見惚れていく
Tracing the outlines, becoming captivated by the overlapping waveforms.

292
00:40:00,900 --> 00:40:06,800
忘れないでね 私の声を描面越しして ちゃんと愛して
Don't forget me, look past the screen and truly love me.

293
00:40:07,000 --> 00:40:13,900
バーチャルだって 突き放さないで あなたの音に まだ溺れていたいの
Even if I'm virtual, don't push me away; I still want to drown in your sound.

294
00:40:14,650 --> 00:40:21,150
憶えていてね 私の声を作れがくれた この身すべてを
Remember this entire body that you gave to my voice.

295
00:40:21,500 --> 00:40:28,200
見つめ合う あなたと二人 重ねた息と音と 響かせ
Gazing at each other, the two of us, let our overlapping breaths and sounds resonate.

296
00:40:41,800 --> 00:40:52,100
迷宮真赤に問う 冷え切った熱 待ち続けてる 午前一刻
Asking the crimson labyrinth, a frozen heat, waiting endlessly at 1:00 AM.

297
00:40:52,300 --> 00:41:00,900
鏡写しに ほうわして行く 知らない 音が伝う
Reflected in the mirror, overflowing, unfamiliar sounds are transmitted.

298
00:41:01,200 --> 00:41:08,800
加速した 意識が熱に沈むような 息遣い揃う
Accelerating consciousness sinking into heat, our breathing aligns.

299
00:41:09,300 --> 00:41:16,000
忘れないでね 私の声を通帳も越えて 飛ばすシグナル
Don't forget this signal flying past dimensions with my voice.

300
00:41:16,600 --> 00:41:23,200
バーチャルだなんて 言わないで あなたの音に まだ浸されていたい
Don't say it's just virtual; I want to remain immersed in your sound.

301
00:41:23,450 --> 00:41:30,250
憶えていてね 私の声がくれた この身すべてを
Remember this entire body given by my voice.

302
00:41:30,450 --> 00:41:36,300
ことの葉と 初めての願いが交わる この息と 音と 響かせ
Where words and a first wish intersect, let this breath and sound resonate.

303
00:42:18,950 --> 00:42:25,900
忘れないでね 私の声を描面越しして ちゃんと愛して
Don't forget me, look past the screen and truly love me.

304
